<view class="page address-page">
  <view class="page-head"><view class="eyebrow">常用资料</view><view class="title">{{selecting ? '选择配送地址' : '我的地址簿'}}</view><view class="page-desc">管理常用联系人，下次填写更从容</view></view>
  <view class="notice" wx:if="{{selecting}}">选择取件或收件地址，也可以先在下方新增。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{error}}"><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary small retry-button" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <view class="loading-note" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取地址…</view>
  <view class="card address-card" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row"><view class="grow address-person">{{item.contact}}<text class="address-phone">{{item.phone}}</text></view><text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.defaultFlag}}">默认</text></view>
    <view class="address-location">{{item.poiName}} {{item.address}}</view>
    <view class="address-toolbar"><button wx:if="{{selecting}}" class="primary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">选择此地址</button><view class="actions"><button class="secondary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">编辑</button><button wx:if="{{!item.defaultFlag}}" class="text-button small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="setDefault" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">设为默认</button><button class="danger small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">删除</button></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!list.length && !loading && !error}}"><view class="empty-mark">址</view><view class="empty-title">还没有常用地址</view><view>在下方添加，方便下次选择</view></view>
  <view class="card address-form"><view class="section-title">{{editingId ? '编辑地址' : '添加新地址'}}</view><view class="hint">先选择省、市、区县，再填写街道与门牌；联系人电话需真实可联系。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{legacyAddress}}">原地址：{{legacyAddress}}。旧地址可继续选择使用；编辑保存时请补选省市区，并将街道门牌填写在详细地址中。</view>
    <view class="field"><text class="label">联系人</text><input value="{{form.contact}}" data-field="contact" bindinput="input" maxlength="30" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="请输入姓名"/></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="label">手机号</text><input value="{{form.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="input" type="number" maxlength="11" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="请输入11位手机号"/></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="label">地点名称 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><input value="{{form.poiName}}" data-field="poiName" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="小区、商场或学校"/></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="label">所在地区</text><picker mode="region" value="{{regionValue}}" bindchange="regionChange" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker address-picker {{regionText ? '' : 'picker-placeholder'}}"><text class="grow">{{regionText || '请选择省 / 市 / 区县'}}</text><text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="label">详细地址</text><input value="{{form.detailAddress}}" data-field="detailAddress" bindinput="input" maxlength="160" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="请填写街道、楼栋、单元和门牌"/><view class="address-field-help">无需重复填写已选择的省市区。选择地区不会自动获取定位。</view></view>
    <label class="switch-row"><switch checked="{{form.isDefault === 1}}" bindchange="defaultChange" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#C94320"/><text>设为默认地址</text></label>
    <view class="actions"><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" bindtap="save">保存地址</button><button wx:if="{{editingId}}" class="secondary" bindtap="reset" disabled="{{busy}}">取消编辑</button></view>
  </view>
</view>
